on value in the running game is not a repeatable property of the agent. The board may render and be sorted by attempt VOLUME, which is a style axis; the plus metric is WITHHELD, exactly as leverage_board does today.","split_half_r":0.0691,"null_band":[-0.1504,0.1243],"clears_null":false,"agent_seasons":240,"median_attempts_per_agent_season":54.0,"smallest_detectable_per_attempt_sd":0.0005,"detection_floor_reading":"the smallest true per-agent per-attempt effect this battery would have detected at 80 percent power. A null without this number is unbounded and says nothing; with it, the null is a ceiling.","variance_explained_by_season":0.7961,"variance_explained_by_team":0.0223,"raw_split_half_r_for_comparison":0.7789,"why_the_raw_number_is_not_the_finding":"the RAW split-half correlation is 0.7789, which looks like a strong repeatable skill and is not one. Both halves of an agent-season sit in the same season, so a league-wide year effect reads as agreement while saying nothing about the club. Season explains 79.6 percent of the variance in a club-season's summed decision value; the club itself explains 2.2 percent. Controlled for season the correlation falls to 0.0691 and lands inside its own permutation band.","null_construction":"decision value permuted WITHIN season, holding every agent-season's attempt count and every season mean fixed. A null that reassigns attempt counts destroys the structure under test and yields a band anything clears.","n_agent_seasons_in_the_split":238,"why_season_controlled":"both halves of an agent-season sit in the same season, so a league-wide year effect reads as split-half agreement while saying nothing about the agent. A prior design note guessed the driver was target mix; that guess was wrong and the correlation between an agent's summed decision value and its share of steals of second is near zero.","what_a_null_decides":"a team-season is an UPPER BOUND on a manager: managers change and teams do not. If a team-season carries no repeatable decision signal in this family, fetching the manager entity to attribute that signal is not worth building FOR THIS FAMILY. It says nothing about the bullpen or the pinch hit, which have more room and have not been measured."},"reference":{"run_expectancy":[{"base_code":0,"bases":"empty","outs":0,"runs":0.503,"n":353444},{"base_code":1,"bases":"1B","outs":0,"runs":0.899,"n":84112},{"base_code":2,"bases":"2B","outs":0,"runs":1.123,"n":22979},{"base_code":3,"bases":"1B 2B","outs":0,"runs":1.502,"n":21178},{"base_code":4,"bases":"3B","outs":0,"runs":1.377,"n":2250},{"base_code":5,"bases":"1B 3B","outs":0,"runs":1.799,"n":7230},{"base_code":6,"bases":"2B 3B","outs":0,"runs":2.0,"n":4209},{"base_code":7,"bases":"loaded","outs":0,"runs":2.36,"n":5728},{"base_code":0,"bases":"empty","outs":1,"runs":0.269,"n":257004},{"base_code":1,"bases":"1B","outs":1,"runs":0.533,"n":103926},{"base_code":2,"bases":"2B","outs":1,"runs":0.688,"n":34826},{"base_code":3,"bases":"1B 2B","outs":1,"runs":0.943,"n":36466},{"base_code":4,"bases":"3B","outs":1,"runs":0.97,"n":10608},{"base_code":5,"bases":"1B 3B","outs":1,"runs":1.193,"n":15923},{"base_code":6,"bases":"2B 3B","outs":1,"runs":1.401,"n":10084},{"base_code":7,"bases":"loaded","outs":1,"runs":1.593,"n":12806},{"base_code":0,"bases":"empty","outs":2,"runs":0.102,"n":204082},{"base_code":1,"bases":"1B","outs":2,"runs":0.229,"n":106301},{"base_code":2,"bases":"2B","outs":2,"runs":0.33,"n":44343},{"base_code":3,"bases":"1B 2B","outs":2,"runs":0.454,"n":44402},{"base_code":4,"bases":"3B","outs":2,"runs":0.372,"n":18003},{"base_code":5,"bases":"1B 3B","outs":2,"runs":0.512,"n":22039},{"base_code":6,"bases":"2B 3B","outs":2,"runs":0.593,"n":10842},{"base_code":7,"bases":"loaded","outs":2,"runs":0.782,"n":16182}],"half_inning_start":{"tied_game":[{"inning":1,"half":"top","score_diff":0,"batting_team_win_prob":null},{"inning":1,"half":"bottom","score_diff":0,"batting_team_win_prob":null},{"inning":2,"half":"top","score_diff":0,"batti