anager is better than any other. The one decision family measured here returned a bounded null: no club's decision value in the running game repeats between halves of its own season, and the battery would have seen an effect of 0.0005 wins per attempt if one existed. That is a ceiling, not a shrug, and it is the reason there is no plus metric on this page."}